{ New to Version 0.83 }
We wanted an artsy way to depict cyber citizens and I think we got it! Buzzing little electrons vibrating in harmony to create life that is you and everyone who lives here. We also have been working on smoother fades and scene transitions and most are working better now. The intro with the moving platform still messes up the faders a bit. 
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39866814/5a4975e03dd7ec56be3557e1df141a35073c3aff.png
{ Down the Road }
The nexus has still been in the background of our work, trying to figure out how to balance that world and make it not to hard because there is a lot of pipes! 

{ Side Projects }
This month we spent a lot of time porting a build to android for Quest 1/2 users! There were some textures and buildings we have to rework as well as lighting, but we have a good working demo now for Applab. Once approved Quest users will get a chance to try out the first 12 levels. We will try to get on the main store with the full release after The Nexus is complete. If the response is good we will most likely be adding a 3rd world. 

{ Patch Notes }
.83 Live SteamEA Release - Fixed signs for Lev 31-32. Added Player and NPC Avatars. Added Scene Fader for all changes. 

Android .84 Release - Created Android build for Quest 1/2. Fixed building textures and rebuilt home building, added light and optimized lighting and graphics for mobile without losing any art style. Built demo (First 12 levels) and waiting for approval for AppLab and will publish to Sidequest as well. Crossing our fingers for Oculus Store. Will wait until the next world is finished on SteamEA.
